ection in the settings if you ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:26:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034952","verified_at":"2026-10-23T09:08:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1846651706685986","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.3.4: Auto supporting characters","summary":"- Supporting characters will now use their Skill and Focus skill abilities automatically (Ultimate still needs to be used manually but is on tap now)- Simplified tutorial- Recommended rewards for your arachetype path will now have a thumbs up icon- You can now press the character icons in the post combat screen as a reminder for what they do.- Warden and Warden P2 animation and stat adjustments- Minor balance changes - A ton of UI/UX/QoL changes.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T02:31:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685986","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1846651706673056","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.3.3: UI Redesign, Sounds, and Mac support","summary":"0.3.3 - UI Redesign (2026/10/13)Full redesign of all UI in the game Added a bunch of sound effects to the gameAdded underlying architecture for achievementsAdded Mac supportSome bug fixes here and there","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T03:34:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673056","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1846018067934944","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.3.2: Archetype Rework","summary":"I'll keep this short so you can discover the changes on your own:Full archetype balancing and rework - All archetypes archetypes now have some kind of visual element to it whenever you play into it Added simplified descriptions for rewards, making it easier for newer players to understand what each reward does. Updated tooltips for rewards for Vanguard's Descent","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T23:42:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934944","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1846018067925111","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.3.1 — Camera and animations","summary":"0.3.1 — Camera and animations Massive animation updates Camerawork for most enemy timestop attacks Added overlord intro Fodder enemies are now spawned periodically All environments are playable in the demo Added some physics to all playable charactersBug fixes & Adjustments","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T06:15:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925111","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1844751498228039","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.3.0: Combat redesign and dungeon branching","summary":"This is one of the biggest patches since launch! Ability target selectionSkill, Focus Skill, and Ultimate now open a target-selection screen. Combat freezes while the screen shows the ability's name, icon, and shape (Single, Blast, or AOE), and a pulsing red overlay marks every enemy it will hit. Choose the primary target with Previous/Next Target or by clicking an enemy. To confirm, press the ability's button again, press Confirm, or click the selected target. The ability only activates and pay","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T20:31:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228039","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1844115010498217","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.2.6: Alden and Dungeon updates","summary":"Characters and progressionAdded Alden: The Vanguard, the fourth playable character and the first unlockable character. Alden can join as a supporting character through a Character Acquisition stage; meeting him permanently unlocks him as a selectable starting character for future runs.Added Alden's complete combat kit: the three-hit Vanguard's Slash, three-cast Blazing Charge, Ignition-storing passive, Flaming Surge Focus Skill, and Blade of Justice Ultimate. His kit adds a new resource-and-empo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T02:00:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498217","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1842846814454037","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.2.5: Camera and Balancing","summary":"Combat and progressionAdded run difficulty scaling. Enemy stats now scale up as the campaign progresses, keeping later dungeons and battles a meaningful step above the opening encounters.Added primary-character death succession. When your lead character falls, another surviving character automatically takes over as the primary, so a single death no longer ends the run outright.Applied another round of combat balancing across enemy actions and character kits.Added a dynamic combat camera. Battles","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T20:59:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454037","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1842846814450073","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.2.4: Accessibility & Controls Update","summary":"Accessibility & Controls UpdateAdded localization for Simplified Chinese, French, Japanese, and Spanish, with an in-game language selector in SettingsAdded full controller support — playable end to end on gamepad, with on-screen button prompts and full menu navigation without a mouseAdded custom key bindings — remap both keyboard/mouse and controller inputs from the Settings menuRevamped the Settings menu with General and Input tabs, plus a new Graphics Quality setting (Low, Medium, High, Epic, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T02:08:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450073","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1842846814439048","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.2.3: Demo Release!","summary":"Version 0.2.3 Update:Official Demo Release!Combat and progression- Added the current three-character archetype matrix: Remi (Break, Consume, Stacker), Aria (Support, Debuffer, Summon), and Ian (Summon, Support, Break).- Reworked the reward catalogue around character amplifiers and global relics. Rewards now have clearer ownership, card icons, level progression, and more consistent descriptions.- Added and tuned the current amplifier sets, including Aria's Summon crystal, the Remi Consume/Stacker","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T02:09:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814439048","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1841579228666188","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.2.1: Tutorial and bugfixes","summary":"Pyro 0.2.1 Changelist:- Added the tutorial, a complete guided intro (the Overlord's Room) covering combat, abilities, and rewards.- Skills now use cooldown charges instead of the old resource model.- Fixed a bunch of bugs- Refactored a bunch of stuff in the backend, especially UI- UI touchups and improvements","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T16:36:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228666188","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4904700-1840944183773061","game_id":"steam-4904700","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.2.0 - First big game update!","summary":"Vanguard's Descent 0.2.0Combat and characters- Completed and refined the playable combat kits for Remi, Ian, and Aria, including Basic Attacks, Skills, Focus Skills, Ultimates, passives, animations, effects, and targeting behavior.- Completed the shared Dodge system.- Players now have two Dodge charges that recover over time.- Perfect Dodges negate incoming hits and immediately restore Dodge charges.- Dodging remains available during enemy Timestop attacks.- Improved ability cancellation and ret","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T05:48:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","conte